# Internal / sensitive docs — kept locally, NEVER tracked or published.
# (patent/FTO analysis, internal review reports, internal status index, etc.)
# CAVEAT: untracking here cleans only the CURRENT tip. These files remain in past
# commits, so a full-history push would still expose them. For a public release,
# publish a clean snapshot (orphan/squash), not the 696-commit internal history.
/private/

# CLAUDE.md is the internal AI-development playbook (internal lessons/conventions).
# Kept at the repo root (Claude Code reads it from there) but untracked so it is
# not published — same intent as /private/, without breaking the tooling path.
/CLAUDE.md
